  "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226558/assets/d91ac29530bd2408ae92cf4ea815d1a155803b8144994184cbaca09a8c0f79e4.png)\n\nWe note the following:\n\n- The points in the scatter plot seem to follow a straight line with a *negative* slope. So, we have a *negative* correlation.\n\n- The points are scattered quite far from the corresponding trend line. So, we have a *weak* correlation.\n\nTherefore, the variables have a *weak negative* linear correlation.",
